# Screenshots of a test template (the picker above the setup form, with a templated
# testbench) and of a suite run (one combined table). Needs PDK_ROOT, CDEPT_NGSPICE,
# CDEPT_XSCHEM. Writes sim-template.png, sim-suite.png.
# Run: scripts/gen-doc-screenshots.sh docs/screenshots/sim-suite.script
window 1400 900
panel Library Manager
wait 0.3
open cells tb_inv tran_delay
sim template_expect tran_delay
wait 0.5
screenshot @SHOTS@/sim-template.png
open cells tb_inv suite
sim suite_run
sim suite_wait
sim suite_expect pass
wait 0.5
screenshot @SHOTS@/sim-suite.png
quit
